            *** Zinc Application Framework 3.5 Demonstration ***

These demonstration programs were created with Zinc Application Framework 3.5,
using Borland C++ 3.1 for DOS and Windows, and Borland C++ 1.0 for OS/2.
The DOS Text, DOS Graphics, MS Windows, and IBM OS/2 versions were compiled
from the same source code (ZINCDEMO.CPP) and share the same platform-
independent resource file (ZINCPOST.DAT).

To install the demo from compact disk, enter: "INSTALL"

To run the demo, enter: "ZINC_DOS" for DOS Graphics Mode
			"ZINC_DOS /T" for DOS Text Mode 
			"WIN ZINC_WIN" for Microsoft Windows
			"ZINC_OS2" for IBM OS/2 (you must run IBM OS/2) 
           
